Place your YOLO barcode detection model here as "barcode_detector.onnx".

Expected format:
- YOLOv8/YOLO11 object detection ONNX export
- Input: [1, 3, 640, 640] NCHW float32 (normalized to [0,1])
- Output: [1, 4+numClasses, numDetections] (YOLOv8 default)

The model file is loaded by YoloDetector.kt at runtime.
If the file is missing, the system automatically falls back to brute-force tile scanning.
